    "title": "St. Petersburg Bank Branch Unveils Dog ATM That Dispenses Free Biscuits - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Wei Chen ,\n1 days ago Dogs walking into the TD Bank branch at 3900 4th Street North in St. Petersburg's Allendale neighborhood can now earn themselves a free snack without their owners spending a dime. The bank has installed the city's first Dog ATM, a machine that looks like a standard cash dispenser but hands out biscuits instead of bills. Read full article",
